      <div class="question-card">
        <h3 class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-xl font-black mb-6">Questions 27 – 31</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-base font-bold">Choose the correct heading for each section from the list of headings below.</p>
        
